      "role": "user",
      "content": "That’s a great start for the mood boards. To help our casting director and photography team, can we get a bit more specific on the actual visual profiles? \n\nWhen we talk about the 'Old Money' look, what kind of ethnic or racial archetypes do you see fitting that 'timeless, heritage' vibe? And for the 'Urban' group, how should we be thinking about their physical appearance and background to make sure the marketing feels authentic to that high-energy, street culture?",
